WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 42

01:38.580 --> 01:40.200
Her kid's father

01:41.860 --> 01:44.200
is Emperor Qing?

01:45.940 --> 01:47.350
That's right.

01:47.370 --> 01:50.200
I think he's at your age.

01:50.260 --> 01:51.450
I'd been imprisoned for so long,

01:51.450 --> 01:53.640
so I don't know too much about the royal family of Nanqing.

01:55.980 --> 01:57.920
I'm not sure

01:58.690 --> 02:01.070
which prince is that kid

02:01.090 --> 02:03.450
or if there is something special about him.

02:04.220 --> 02:06.600
The capital city is not a good place.

02:06.620 --> 02:08.730
The late emperor died there.

02:09.340 --> 02:11.610
Your mom died there.

02:11.930 --> 02:16.250
You can live longer if you stay in Danzhou.

02:22.780 --> 02:24.160
My mom was killed in the capital city.

02:24.180 --> 02:25.630
Are those killers still alive?

02:25.650 --> 02:27.120
I have no idea.

02:27.570 --> 02:30.760
We've received an imperial decree to
summon you into the imperial palace.

02:32.210 --> 02:34.040
I see.

02:34.140 --> 02:35.620
This is the truth hidden

02:35.620 --> 02:38.120
by Chen Pingping and Fan Jian.

02:38.340 --> 02:39.260
This is why they kept me away from

02:39.260 --> 02:41.730
the capital city for so many years.

02:42.370 --> 02:44.640
I don't belong to the Fan family.

02:45.850 --> 02:47.890
I'm the son of Emperor Qing.

02:48.620 --> 02:50.450
I'm a prince.

02:51.290 --> 02:52.830
His blood is running

02:52.850 --> 02:55.000
in my veins.

02:57.420 --> 03:01.250
I'm a bit tired and need a rest.

03:01.490 --> 03:03.970
Finish it by yourselves.

03:07.540 --> 03:11.040
You don't have to kneel down if you don't feel like it.

03:11.340 --> 03:13.010
This is different from the palace.

03:13.010 --> 03:14.090
We're in the monarch-subject relationship in palace,

03:14.090 --> 03:14.570
but here...

03:14.570 --> 03:16.120
What's the difference?

03:19.180 --> 03:21.250
Come back alive.

03:30.570 --> 03:34.370
Knowing so many things all at once

03:34.370 --> 03:37.000
and knowing your true identity all of a sudden,

03:37.900 --> 03:39.920
it can be hard to accept.

03:40.490 --> 03:42.040
It's fine

03:42.140 --> 03:43.010
as long as you know

03:43.010 --> 03:45.480
you're a descendent of the Xiao family.

03:46.820 --> 03:48.400
I feel so relaxed

03:48.420 --> 03:49.810
after telling the secret

03:50.180 --> 03:51.840
kept for so long.

03:52.820 --> 03:55.640
But next, the burden

03:55.820 --> 03:58.170
is on you.

04:00.700 --> 04:02.690
You'd better stop talking.

04:05.180 --> 04:08.530
I'm dying. What's the difference?

04:09.090 --> 04:11.090
It's so dim in the cave.

04:12.540 --> 04:14.350
Having been locked up for so many years,

04:14.370 --> 04:16.570
I don't like it here.

04:39.140 --> 04:42.640
The scenery is so good here.

04:52.370 --> 04:55.050
Don't let Ku He know

04:55.050 --> 04:56.630
I told you everything.

04:56.650 --> 04:58.130
I see.

04:58.420 --> 05:00.760
Otherwise, he'll kill me instead.

05:04.860 --> 05:06.880
What's your plan for the future?

05:07.420 --> 05:09.040
Staying in Beiqi

05:09.650 --> 05:11.520
or going back to Nanqing?

05:11.540 --> 05:13.010
Going back to Nanqing.

05:13.050 --> 05:14.190
Right.

05:14.210 --> 05:16.290
Your roots are there.

05:16.460 --> 05:17.890
Chen Pingping has no idea that

05:17.890 --> 05:19.630
you've known the truth.

05:19.650 --> 05:22.090
You can accomplish great deeds.

05:23.490 --> 05:25.480
Before going back,

05:25.930 --> 05:29.410
you should visit Zhuang Mohan when you're free.

05:30.210 --> 05:32.480
Inform him of my death.

05:32.540 --> 05:34.370
I will.

05:34.860 --> 05:36.400
What else can I do for you?

05:36.420 --> 05:38.810
After I die, let me sit here.

05:39.490 --> 05:41.250
Don't bury me.

05:42.610 --> 05:46.880
I don't want to be buried under the ground ever again.

05:47.330 --> 05:48.640
OK.

05:51.170 --> 05:53.320
No need to avenge my death.

05:53.460 --> 05:56.090
Don't provoke Chen Pingping.

05:56.580 --> 05:59.160
Bury everything deep in your heart,

05:59.700 --> 06:01.600
and live a happy life.

06:02.740 --> 06:04.370
I know.

06:05.170 --> 06:06.690
Tell me.

06:06.930 --> 06:09.720
Will I see them after I die?

06:15.540 --> 06:17.010
See whom?

06:17.090 --> 06:20.250
Ye Qingmei, and your son?

06:36.540 --> 06:38.010
Yes.

06:39.140 --> 06:40.640
You will see them.

06:50.770 --> 06:52.200
Thank you

06:52.260 --> 06:54.410
for telling me who I am.

06:56.420 --> 06:58.850
It's a pity that I'm not your grandson.

07:01.330 --> 07:03.130
Sit in peace.

07:03.260 --> 07:05.370
No one will disturb you anymore.

07:32.260 --> 07:33.960
So it's for the divine temple.

07:33.980 --> 07:35.090
The secret of Xiao En

07:35.090 --> 07:36.720
is the divine temple.

07:36.740 --> 07:38.120
Wuzhu lost his memory.

07:38.140 --> 07:39.020
Ku He will never

07:39.020 --> 07:40.460
break his promise.

07:40.460 --> 07:42.070
The only hope

07:42.090 --> 07:44.720
to find the divine temple is Xiao En.

07:45.210 --> 07:48.070
He remained silent for years of torture.

07:48.090 --> 07:49.750
Will he really tell Fan Xian?

07:49.770 --> 07:50.820
He will as long as he believes that

07:50.820 --> 07:53.200
Fan Xian is his grandson.

07:53.740 --> 07:56.030
That's why for so many years,

07:56.050 --> 07:58.170
you didn't allow me to bring Fan Xian

07:58.170 --> 07:59.880
to the capital city.

08:00.700 --> 08:02.370
Firstly, I wanted to keep Fan Xian safe.

08:02.370 --> 08:03.560
Secondly,

08:03.580 --> 08:05.640
I was waiting for the perfect chance.

08:05.700 --> 08:07.910
To have Xiao En leave the Investigator's Office

08:07.930 --> 08:09.470
and meet Fan Xian,

08:09.490 --> 08:11.070
everything should make sense.

08:11.090 --> 08:14.130
No trace of manipulation shall be found.

08:15.050 --> 08:16.640
Right.

08:17.460 --> 08:19.090
The timing before the two countries started a war

08:19.090 --> 08:20.870
was the best chance.

08:20.890 --> 08:24.720
When the war ended, win or lose,

08:25.300 --> 08:27.240
Shangshan Hu and Zhuang Mohan

08:27.260 --> 08:30.480
would request to get Xiao En back.

08:31.770 --> 08:35.370
So Fan Xian came to the capital city.

08:39.370 --> 08:42.570
No wonder you left the capital city

08:42.970 --> 08:44.760
on purpose.

08:44.780 --> 08:45.910
I thought

08:45.930 --> 08:47.920
I finally found the chance

08:48.100 --> 08:49.850
to bring him to the capital city.

08:49.850 --> 08:51.400
Actually,

08:51.610 --> 08:53.890
it was arranged by you.

08:55.050 --> 08:56.950
His Majesty picked the timing.

08:56.970 --> 08:59.010
Was the Danzhou assassination

08:59.340 --> 09:01.570
also planned by His Majesty?

09:02.340 --> 09:05.580
Li Yunrui started the assassination.

09:05.580 --> 09:07.680
I just made use of the opportunity.

09:07.700 --> 09:10.130
What if Fan Xian was assassinated?

09:12.490 --> 09:14.280
Have you ever thought about it?

09:14.340 --> 09:16.140
The Sixth Division is in charge of assassination.

09:16.140 --> 09:17.710
Why was the task given to

09:17.730 --> 09:20.650
Teng Zijing of the Fourth Division?

09:27.700 --> 09:29.650
That's because one month before that,

09:29.930 --> 09:31.470
I had sent away all the officials of

09:31.490 --> 09:32.970
the Investigator's Office

09:32.970 --> 09:34.450
around Danzhou,

09:34.580 --> 09:36.640
and Teng Zijing of the Fourth Division was the only one left.

09:36.660 --> 09:38.120
Only he

09:38.140 --> 09:40.710
could fulfill the task.

09:40.730 --> 09:42.400
Was he also

09:43.340 --> 09:45.250
picked by you in advance?

09:46.930 --> 09:48.340
The officials from the Sixth Division

09:48.340 --> 09:49.350
are hard-heartened.

09:49.370 --> 09:52.370
They would definitely kill Fan Xian
if they took the secret order.

09:53.490 --> 09:55.280
Whatever Fan Xian might say,

09:55.370 --> 09:57.250
they wouldn't explain.

09:57.900 --> 09:59.720
In the Investigator's Office,

10:00.700 --> 10:03.400
only a few are chivalrous

10:04.290 --> 10:05.920
and dare to defy the authority.

10:11.610 --> 10:13.450
So Teng Zijing

10:14.260 --> 10:16.450
was one of them.

10:20.780 --> 10:25.480
Teng Zijing was picked by His Majesty.

10:48.460 --> 10:49.140
I thought you've

10:49.140 --> 10:50.770
forgotten me.

10:51.930 --> 10:53.370
What are you reading?

10:54.140 --> 10:56.400
Stories of Beiqi.

10:56.820 --> 10:58.840
Now that I'm here,

10:59.290 --> 11:00.170
I'd better have further understanding

11:00.170 --> 11:02.160
on the customs here.

11:04.580 --> 11:06.450
You're different than before.

11:09.140 --> 11:11.080
What can I do for you?

11:12.820 --> 11:15.040
I do have something for you.

11:15.660 --> 11:17.450
But before that,

11:18.140 --> 11:19.890
I want to ask you a question.

11:22.260 --> 11:24.250
Do you remember Teng Zijing?

11:24.370 --> 11:25.510
Your guard killed

11:25.530 --> 11:27.590
on the Niulan Street?

11:27.610 --> 11:29.650
He had a problem with you.

11:31.170 --> 11:32.950
You were splashed with dirty water on the street,

11:32.970 --> 11:34.890
and your guards hit him.

11:36.290 --> 11:37.830
That's right.

11:37.850 --> 11:39.640
Later, you asked Ministry of Penalty

11:39.660 --> 11:41.810
to arrest Teng Zijing for assassination.

11:43.140 --> 11:43.880
My butler

11:43.900 --> 11:44.950
did that.

11:44.970 --> 11:47.130
I only heard about it.

11:48.460 --> 11:50.150
So you didn't give the order.

11:50.170 --> 11:51.170
Of course I didn't.

11:51.170 --> 11:52.370
How could I trouble myself

11:52.370 --> 11:54.040
for a civilian?

11:56.100 --> 11:57.960
His entire family was executed for this.

11:59.580 --> 12:01.470
What a heavy sentence!

12:01.490 --> 12:03.390
Neither did you add fuel to the fire behind the back?

12:03.410 --> 12:04.710
Of course not.

12:04.730 --> 12:06.220
I forgot about it the other day.

12:06.220 --> 12:07.450
Fine.

12:07.530 --> 12:08.640
After that,

12:08.660 --> 12:10.690
Teng Zijing was saved by the Investigator's Office

12:10.820 --> 12:12.470
and sent away from the capital city.

12:12.490 --> 12:13.260
Did you send people

12:13.260 --> 12:14.890
to harass his wife and son?

12:16.050 --> 12:17.840
What do you mean?

12:18.820 --> 12:21.590
I am the son of Minister of Board of Rites,

12:21.610 --> 12:24.440
the Imperial Compiler and the follower of the Crown Prince.

12:24.460 --> 12:26.240
I have a bright future ahead.

12:26.260 --> 12:28.030
Why should I do that?

12:28.050 --> 12:28.610
I...

12:28.610 --> 12:29.530
By doing that,

12:29.530 --> 12:31.570
I would ruin my name, wouldn't I?

12:38.660 --> 12:39.530
It was not you.

12:39.530 --> 12:41.200
Of course not.

12:41.220 --> 12:43.320
Trivial as it was,

12:43.340 --> 12:45.450
I forgot it after my guards hit him.

12:45.580 --> 12:48.370
How would I go so far as to destroy his entire family?

12:48.820 --> 12:49.970
Do you think our family

12:49.970 --> 12:51.470
has no rules?

12:51.490 --> 12:53.570
What a coincidence!

12:54.100 --> 12:55.460
I arrived in the capital city

12:55.460 --> 12:56.890
right at that time.

12:57.140 --> 12:58.370
What?

12:59.900 --> 13:02.280
It was all calculated

13:02.780 --> 13:03.660
only for me

13:03.660 --> 13:05.250
to meet Xiao En.

13:06.020 --> 13:07.770
Xiao En?

13:08.340 --> 13:09.510
Haven't we

13:09.530 --> 13:11.370
given him back to Beiqi?

13:12.020 --> 13:14.450
I believe you didn't lie.

13:14.850 --> 13:17.040
Neither did Teng Zijing.

13:18.820 --> 13:20.690
So all this was set up

13:22.460 --> 13:25.160
by the Investigator's Office.

13:25.290 --> 13:27.010
What do you mean?

13:27.290 --> 13:28.610
What's the relation

13:28.610 --> 13:30.160
between Xiao En and Teng Zijing?

13:37.530 --> 13:39.160
Even if Li Yunrui didn't give

13:39.580 --> 13:41.510
the fake order of assassination,

13:41.530 --> 13:44.440
the Investigator's Office would make sure that

13:44.460 --> 13:46.960
Fan Xian made trouble in Danzhou.

13:53.100 --> 13:55.010
Everybody is

13:55.220 --> 13:57.520
on your chessboard.

13:58.530 --> 14:02.210
We're chess pieces in your game.

14:02.260 --> 14:03.490
It's not my game.

14:03.490 --> 14:07.470
His Majesty is the real chess player.

14:07.490 --> 14:09.890
Even if it's for the divine temple,

14:10.460 --> 14:12.050
is it worth risking

14:12.050 --> 14:13.890
Fan Xian's life?

14:15.660 --> 14:18.330
You know how many secrets

14:18.970 --> 14:22.020
our lady had back then.

14:22.020 --> 14:23.020
Those secrets,

14:23.020 --> 14:24.560
those creative ideas

14:24.580 --> 14:26.840
were all from the divine temple.

14:27.700 --> 14:29.510
It holds resources

14:29.530 --> 14:31.710
and wondrous items

14:31.730 --> 14:33.370
transcending the era.

14:34.220 --> 14:36.250
As long as we have the divine temple,

14:36.370 --> 14:40.210
Nanqing will override any other country

14:40.260 --> 14:42.450
and become the center of the world.

14:44.580 --> 14:46.040
For Nanqing,

14:47.170 --> 14:49.330
any risk is worth taking.

14:52.780 --> 14:54.130
Right.

14:54.850 --> 14:57.400
It's all for Nanqing.

14:57.660 --> 14:59.770
But for Nanqing,

15:01.020 --> 15:04.250
even my son has become a chess piece.

15:09.140 --> 15:11.280
I have nothing to say.

15:33.730 --> 15:35.840
What an old man!

15:43.660 --> 15:45.000
But

15:45.020 --> 15:47.150
I can understand that

15:47.170 --> 15:49.330
he cares for Fan Xian deeply.

15:50.610 --> 15:54.450
I woke up this morning because of a bad dream.

15:54.610 --> 15:56.850
I didn't remember what it was about.

15:56.850 --> 15:59.040
I just woke up with a start.

15:59.140 --> 16:00.370
Your Majesty.

16:01.410 --> 16:02.810
He said

16:03.260 --> 16:05.440
Fan Xian is a chess piece,

16:05.460 --> 16:08.330
but more importantly, he's my son.

16:08.700 --> 16:10.080
Right.

16:10.370 --> 16:12.000
Whatever Your Majesty did

16:12.020 --> 16:13.050
is for Nanqing.

16:13.050 --> 16:14.560
It's worth it.

16:14.580 --> 16:16.890
Fan Jian might not think so.

16:17.900 --> 16:18.930
He really

16:18.930 --> 16:21.030
treats Fan Xian as a son.

16:21.050 --> 16:22.450
He has complaints.

16:22.580 --> 16:24.330
He'll think it through.

16:24.460 --> 16:25.640
Don't you also

16:25.660 --> 16:28.690
treat Fan Xian as a son?

16:29.170 --> 16:30.520
Yes.

16:30.610 --> 16:34.260
But when I ordered you to withdraw the black knights

16:34.260 --> 16:36.250
to drive him to the last ditch,

16:36.290 --> 16:38.960
you didn't hesitate at all.

16:39.260 --> 16:41.780
I know who I am.

16:41.780 --> 16:43.450
Who are you?

16:47.220 --> 16:49.450
Chen Pingping.

16:49.930 --> 16:52.690
An old dog beside Your Majesty.

16:52.930 --> 16:54.340
Disabled as I am,

16:54.340 --> 16:56.350
I still lead the Investigator's Office

16:56.370 --> 16:58.770
because of Your Majesty's trust.

16:58.820 --> 17:00.910
I do treat him as a son,

17:00.930 --> 17:03.080
but I'm only loyal

17:03.170 --> 17:05.320
to Your Majesty.

17:05.340 --> 17:06.930
Your Majesty, as long as you give the order,

17:07.050 --> 17:08.480
let alone my son,

17:08.500 --> 17:10.130
I can give away my life

17:10.460 --> 17:14.200
with a smile.

17:16.930 --> 17:18.960
I heard you.

17:19.700 --> 17:21.600
In the whole country among millions of my subjects,

17:21.620 --> 17:22.990
you're the most loyal

17:23.010 --> 17:24.740
to me.

17:24.740 --> 17:26.250
I know.

17:26.860 --> 17:28.530
I see.

17:29.530 --> 17:31.230
It's late.

17:31.250 --> 17:33.770
I'm going back.

18:04.100 --> 18:05.250
Your Majesty.

18:06.650 --> 18:08.130
Gong Dian.

18:11.220 --> 18:13.930
Chen Pingping is in the courtyard now.

18:14.380 --> 18:15.870
Follow him.

18:15.890 --> 18:17.600
Find out who he meets

18:17.620 --> 18:18.960
and what they talk.

18:18.980 --> 18:22.080
Monitor Head Chen?

18:23.340 --> 18:25.270
In Nanqing,

18:25.290 --> 18:29.840
I trust you the most.

18:30.650 --> 18:33.080
Your Majesty, I would never fail you.

18:33.100 --> 18:34.440
Let's go back.

18:56.010 --> 18:57.410
Fan Jian,

18:57.530 --> 18:59.680
it's not a good thing to have too many questions.

18:59.700 --> 19:01.650
One thing you should know.

19:01.930 --> 19:03.680
He's still surnamed Fan.

19:03.700 --> 19:05.770
I'm still his father.

19:05.820 --> 19:07.530
What do you want to ask?

19:19.620 --> 19:22.800
Your Excellency, you're finally back.

19:22.820 --> 19:24.630
How's it going? Are you OK?

19:24.650 --> 19:25.960
Has Yan Bingyun made a move?

19:25.980 --> 19:26.840
No.

19:26.860 --> 19:28.770
He just stays in the room quietly.

19:44.700 --> 19:46.410
Are you still reading the account book?

19:47.740 --> 19:49.370
Is Shen Zhong dead?

19:51.500 --> 19:52.720
No.

19:53.010 --> 19:54.320
I lied to you.

19:54.580 --> 19:55.680
The target of this operation

19:55.700 --> 19:57.030
was not Shen Zhong,

19:57.050 --> 19:58.480
but Shangshan Hu.

20:00.930 --> 20:02.370
Why did you lie to me?

20:03.130 --> 20:05.390
I wanted to know whether you would make a move

20:05.410 --> 20:07.800
when Shen Zhong took the bait.

20:07.820 --> 20:10.200
You think I might collude with the enemy.

20:12.250 --> 20:14.200
Just as you're suspicious of me,

20:14.340 --> 20:15.770
I also wanted to know

20:15.820 --> 20:17.440
after being tortured by Embroidered Uniform Guards for so long,

20:17.460 --> 20:18.720
have you yielded

20:18.740 --> 20:20.840
and become Shen Zhong's spy?

20:24.460 --> 20:25.270
Good!

20:25.290 --> 20:26.510
Aren't you angry?

20:26.530 --> 20:28.360
Only by being skeptical

20:28.380 --> 20:29.340
can you be a worthy Director-General

20:29.340 --> 20:31.530
of the Investigator's Office.

20:31.700 --> 20:33.200
I'm satisfied that

20:33.220 --> 20:34.890
you're skeptical of everything.

20:35.050 --> 20:36.560
What we're going to do next is

20:36.580 --> 20:38.200
to get the secret behind

20:38.220 --> 20:40.510
the account book out of Shen Zhong

20:40.530 --> 20:41.890
and find out

20:41.890 --> 20:44.320
who actually benefit from the dirty money.

20:47.170 --> 20:49.650
I can help you with that,

20:50.220 --> 20:52.080
but you have to return me the favor.

20:52.580 --> 20:53.910
What can I do for you?

20:53.930 --> 20:55.530
I've no idea yet.

20:56.460 --> 20:58.930
We might start from one little thing.

20:59.220 --> 21:00.320
What's that?

21:00.340 --> 21:02.320
Do you understand Chen Pingping?

21:03.700 --> 21:04.410
No one can

21:04.410 --> 21:05.740
truly understand Head Chen.

21:05.740 --> 21:08.010
If Chen Pingping tells a lie,

21:08.620 --> 21:12.050
how true can it be?

21:21.130 --> 21:22.380
Don't you want to ask me something?

21:22.380 --> 21:24.170
Why don't you speak?

21:24.740 --> 21:28.080
If obtaining the divine temple is for the benefits of Nanqing,

21:30.010 --> 21:32.560
which is more important

21:33.410 --> 21:35.480
to you and His Majesty,

21:35.500 --> 21:37.440
Nanqing or Fan Xian?

21:42.700 --> 21:43.960
You can't compare apples and oranges.

21:43.980 --> 21:46.010
If you have to choose between the two,

21:46.860 --> 21:48.630
will you choose Nanqing

21:48.650 --> 21:50.250
or Fan Xian?

21:52.170 --> 21:54.480
Why do we have to choose?

21:54.530 --> 21:57.080
Fan Jian, you should know that

21:57.100 --> 22:00.230
my biggest wish is

22:00.250 --> 22:02.290
to obtain the resources and know the secrets of the divine temple

22:02.290 --> 22:04.440
so as to make Nanqing a long-lasting dynasty.

22:04.460 --> 22:05.800
So,

22:06.340 --> 22:08.410
you'll choose Nanqing.

22:13.460 --> 22:15.720
Why can't we have both?

22:17.290 --> 22:18.890
I just feel that

22:19.580 --> 22:20.990
one day,

22:21.010 --> 22:23.130
we'll have to make such a choice.

22:24.500 --> 22:26.370
I can tell you.

22:26.740 --> 22:29.720
I will choose Fan Xian. I will choose my son.

22:32.770 --> 22:34.480
One last thing.

22:34.740 --> 22:36.630
In your story just now,

22:36.650 --> 22:38.800
you've been avoiding one thing.

22:38.890 --> 22:40.930
Does Xiao En's grandson

22:41.500 --> 22:43.800
really exist?

22:46.100 --> 22:46.890
Yes.

22:46.890 --> 22:48.650
You didn't kill him?

22:49.980 --> 22:51.250
No.

22:51.530 --> 22:53.410
On this matter,

22:53.500 --> 22:55.890
I didn't lie to Xiao En.

22:55.930 --> 22:57.480
I did turn his grandson

22:57.500 --> 22:59.440
into a Nanqing citizen.

22:59.460 --> 23:01.150
I cultivated him into a warrior

23:01.170 --> 23:03.440
who hates Beiqi to the core.

23:03.460 --> 23:05.720
Is he in the Investigator's Office?

23:09.220 --> 23:13.130
Good for you, Chen Pingping.

23:27.770 --> 23:29.560
What's the point of asking me that?

23:29.580 --> 23:31.010
In the Investigator's Office,

23:31.170 --> 23:32.750
how many people are my age?

23:32.770 --> 23:33.990
Why do you ask?

23:34.010 --> 23:36.680
Don't worry. It won't do harm to Nanqing.

23:38.770 --> 23:42.250
There're a lot. I can't tell the number.

23:42.530 --> 23:44.650
For example, we are of the same age.

23:45.010 --> 23:45.980
The Investigator's Office always

23:45.980 --> 23:47.720
cultivates trusted subordinates when they are little,

23:47.740 --> 23:49.010
so I really can't

23:49.010 --> 23:49.960
tell the number.

23:49.980 --> 23:51.560
What did you just say?

23:51.650 --> 23:53.480
You are also the same age as me?

23:53.530 --> 23:55.680
Right. What's wrong?

23:57.130 --> 23:59.080
Have you ever seen your birth mother?

24:00.170 --> 24:01.510
What kind of a question is that?

24:01.530 --> 24:03.370
Just pretend I'm curious.

24:05.170 --> 24:07.530
My mother passed away when giving birth to me.

24:07.740 --> 24:09.530
I wasn't lucky enough to see her.

24:09.620 --> 24:11.680
Have you spent much time with your father?

24:11.860 --> 24:13.680
My father is strict with me.

24:13.740 --> 24:14.460
He entrusted me to others

24:14.460 --> 24:16.250
when I was a child.

24:16.740 --> 24:18.360
Though we seldom meet,

24:18.380 --> 24:20.290
it's for my own good.

24:24.380 --> 24:26.080
Is there anything wrong?

24:34.340 --> 24:35.250
So everything is exactly

24:35.250 --> 24:36.930
as he expected.

24:37.460 --> 24:39.600
Teng Zijing was your man.

24:40.460 --> 24:42.150
If he tried to assassinate me,

24:42.170 --> 24:44.370
you would take the blame in the end.

24:45.290 --> 24:47.150
Why do you bring that up?

24:47.170 --> 24:48.600
So,

24:49.010 --> 24:49.820
you were destined

24:49.820 --> 24:51.680
to lurk in Shangjing.

24:51.820 --> 24:53.200
Why was it destined?

24:53.220 --> 24:54.720
Who could predict in advance that

24:54.740 --> 24:56.560
Teng Zijing would take the fake order?

24:56.580 --> 24:58.840
Who could predict in advance?

25:03.010 --> 25:04.890
So he knew in advance that

25:05.500 --> 25:07.960
Xiao En would be used to exchange you.

25:08.740 --> 25:09.960
Even if Xiao En survived

25:09.980 --> 25:11.800
in Beiqi by luck,

25:12.250 --> 25:14.370
you would go back to Nanqing.

25:15.820 --> 25:17.840
No matter how you struggle,

25:19.050 --> 25:21.410
you'll never go beyond his control.

25:24.500 --> 25:25.130
Fan Xian,

25:25.130 --> 25:27.050
what on earth do you want to say?

25:27.530 --> 25:29.150
Xiao En said

25:29.170 --> 25:30.170
Chen Pingping is

25:30.170 --> 25:32.320
a manipulative villain.

25:34.100 --> 25:35.840
Indeed,

25:36.890 --> 25:39.680
everything is under his control.

25:40.100 --> 25:42.150
It's true that Head asked me

25:42.170 --> 25:44.170
to stay and serve you.

25:44.170 --> 25:45.990
It's also you that sent secret messages

25:46.010 --> 25:47.320
to black knights, right?

25:47.340 --> 25:48.890
Who are you?

25:49.290 --> 25:50.500
Why does Chen Pingping

25:50.500 --> 25:51.750
send the black knights for you?

25:51.770 --> 25:53.150
You may not believe

25:53.170 --> 25:54.530
it's the first time for me to hear this name.

25:54.530 --> 25:55.990
Chen Pingping from the Investigator's Office

25:56.010 --> 25:57.870
is publicly known as King of Nights

25:57.890 --> 25:59.080
and the source of all sins.

25:59.100 --> 26:01.320
You prove yourself to be Head of the Investigator's Office.

26:01.340 --> 26:02.630
Nobody else could be

26:02.650 --> 26:05.230
more scheming and calculating than you.

26:05.250 --> 26:07.080
Stay away from the Investigator's Office

26:07.100 --> 26:09.270
in future.

26:09.290 --> 26:11.230
Don't believe Chen Pingping.

26:11.250 --> 26:12.410
What kind of person is he?

26:12.410 --> 26:14.680
He's well known for being resourceful,

26:14.890 --> 26:17.390
capricious and ruthless.

26:17.410 --> 26:20.200
I find it safer inside.

26:21.620 --> 26:22.910
Find more allies.

26:22.930 --> 26:24.410
Don't rely solely on

26:24.500 --> 26:26.110
Chen Pingping.

26:26.130 --> 26:29.480
Tactics...

26:29.500 --> 26:31.630
I'll assist you secretly

26:31.650 --> 26:33.080
to turn you into the No.1 minister

26:33.100 --> 26:34.510
of Nanqing.

26:34.530 --> 26:36.720
No one will be able to jeopardize

26:37.010 --> 26:39.170
your safety by then.

26:39.290 --> 26:41.010
Humanity...

26:41.930 --> 26:45.200
You should wear more. Don't catch a cold.

26:45.860 --> 26:47.530
You have her eyes.

26:47.530 --> 26:48.650
Who is she?

26:48.650 --> 26:51.720
Ye Qingmei. Your mother.

26:51.740 --> 26:53.080
But I'll have to

26:53.100 --> 26:54.800
return it to you after all.

26:54.820 --> 26:58.990
The time may have passed,
but my original intension remains the same.

26:59.010 --> 27:00.320
Tell me

27:00.340 --> 27:01.480
if anything bothers you.

27:01.500 --> 27:03.360
Tell me also

27:03.380 --> 27:04.800
if anyone makes it hard for you.

27:04.820 --> 27:06.910
I'll help you out.

27:06.930 --> 27:09.410
I'll take care of the rest about Lin Gong's issue.

27:09.930 --> 27:11.130
I think you're a good person.

27:11.130 --> 27:13.960
Me? A good person?

27:15.460 --> 27:16.960
Emotion...

27:19.580 --> 27:21.800
These are all chess pieces in his game.

27:22.580 --> 27:23.750
Fan Xian, how can you be

27:23.770 --> 27:25.680
so disrespectful to the Head?

27:48.010 --> 27:50.170
Chen Pingping,

27:55.980 --> 27:57.720
all my life,

27:58.860 --> 28:03.840
it's the first time I fear someone so much.

28:13.500 --> 28:14.800
Your Majesty,

28:15.010 --> 28:17.030
when you were out these days,

28:17.050 --> 28:19.110
everyone inside the imperial palace

28:19.130 --> 28:21.370
was at a loss without the mainstay.

28:22.290 --> 28:25.030
Your Majesty, Director Gong is here.

28:25.050 --> 28:26.440
Let him in.

28:30.340 --> 28:31.600
Your Majesty.

28:31.620 --> 28:33.050
Leave us.

28:35.620 --> 28:36.440
How's it going?

28:36.460 --> 28:37.720
Your Majesty,

28:37.770 --> 28:38.560
Head Chen

28:38.580 --> 28:40.440
ran into Minister Fan

28:40.460 --> 28:43.600
when leaving the Taiping Residence.

28:43.700 --> 28:45.770
What did Head Chen say?

28:45.890 --> 28:48.600
Head Chen told Minister Fan that

28:48.860 --> 28:50.270
he wants to make Nanqing

28:50.290 --> 28:53.480
a long-lasting dynasty.

28:53.500 --> 28:55.600
A long-lasting dynasty?

29:04.620 --> 29:05.990
Head, you look

29:06.010 --> 29:07.360
so exhausted.

29:07.380 --> 29:09.010
I had a heart-to-heart talk.

29:09.980 --> 29:11.440
A heart-to-heart talk?

29:15.460 --> 29:16.720
Well,

29:16.740 --> 29:19.800
I'm fine. Just leave.

29:41.340 --> 29:42.720
Stop.

29:44.650 --> 29:46.050
Yes.

29:50.220 --> 29:53.840
Did Head Chen really say that?

29:59.580 --> 30:01.680
I've remembered every word he said.

30:01.700 --> 30:03.510
I dare not tell a lie.

30:03.530 --> 30:06.110
Head Chen's loyalty to Your Majesty

30:06.130 --> 30:07.960
is second to none.

30:08.250 --> 30:10.410
Second to none?

30:11.290 --> 30:13.200
Turn around.

30:13.650 --> 30:17.050
I've succeeded in making the Armor Piercing Arrow.

30:26.700 --> 30:28.530
What else do you want to say?

30:32.740 --> 30:34.930
Long live Nanqing.

30:38.700 --> 30:40.600
Open your eyes.

30:53.220 --> 30:54.960
Why don't you hide?

30:58.220 --> 31:02.010
Your Majesty, you didn't order me to hide.

31:05.380 --> 31:07.800
To build a long-lasing Nanqing,

31:08.220 --> 31:09.750
I can't do it on my own.

31:09.770 --> 31:12.770
I still have to count on loyal ministers as you.

31:15.980 --> 31:17.360
Rise.

31:17.380 --> 31:19.050
Thank you, Your Majesty.

31:55.170 --> 31:57.010
He's here! He's here!

31:57.500 --> 31:59.770
Just leave. Stop waiting.

32:01.380 --> 32:03.130
Don't shout! Don't shout!

32:03.580 --> 32:05.770
I'll take up your challenges tomorrow.

32:05.770 --> 32:07.480
Come earlier.

32:08.100 --> 32:09.680
Leave!

32:10.860 --> 32:12.930
Leave! Leave! Leave!

32:15.340 --> 32:16.930
Let's come tomorrow.

32:21.650 --> 32:22.740
Fan Xian went back

32:22.740 --> 32:24.030
to the mission alone.

32:24.050 --> 32:25.440
We didn't see Xiao En.

32:25.460 --> 32:27.170
Xiao En is dead.

32:28.740 --> 32:30.360
Are you sure?

32:30.380 --> 32:31.680
His heart arteries were broken.

32:31.700 --> 32:33.390
Even if my master was there,

32:33.410 --> 32:35.050
he wouldn't be able to save Xiao En.

32:37.460 --> 32:39.960
Was there anything unusual in He Daoren's fight?

32:39.980 --> 32:41.370
Nothing unusual.

32:43.890 --> 32:46.250
I'm too suspicious after all.

32:46.890 --> 32:48.320
What did you imply

32:48.340 --> 32:49.770
by saying those words?

32:50.170 --> 32:51.560
Nothing.

32:51.930 --> 32:53.750
As to Head Chen's chess game,

32:53.770 --> 32:55.370
what does it mean?

32:58.220 --> 32:59.200
Where's Xiao En?

32:59.220 --> 33:00.200
He's dead.

33:00.220 --> 33:01.230
Did he tell you the secret

33:01.250 --> 33:03.250
before his death?

33:04.770 --> 33:06.910
Did she marry Emperor Qing?

33:06.930 --> 33:09.250
They didn't hold a wedding ceremony,

33:09.250 --> 33:12.080
but they were actually a couple.

33:12.530 --> 33:14.860
Ye Qingmei was also pregnant

33:14.860 --> 33:16.650
with his baby.

33:21.500 --> 33:22.800
Which do you think is better,

33:22.820 --> 33:24.890
to be a minister

33:26.250 --> 33:28.370
or to be a prince?

33:29.890 --> 33:32.170
What kind of a weird question is that?

33:35.100 --> 33:38.010
The Crown Prince is competing with the Second Prince.

33:39.580 --> 33:41.630
Whoever loses in the end

33:41.650 --> 33:43.680
can only die.

33:43.700 --> 33:45.080
How can we make improper comments

33:45.100 --> 33:46.930
on the imperial family?

33:47.460 --> 33:48.340
In this sense,

33:48.340 --> 33:50.560
it's safer to be a minister.

33:51.980 --> 33:53.650
How can we choose?

33:54.620 --> 33:55.960
Right.

33:56.290 --> 33:59.080
We can't choose our bloodline.

33:59.100 --> 34:01.370
It's destined after all.

34:01.740 --> 34:04.130
Did Xiao En tell you something?

34:07.530 --> 34:08.610
Come here.

34:08.770 --> 34:10.040
Take a seat.

34:21.820 --> 34:23.710
Zhu Ge, Director of the First Division
of the Investigator's Office

34:23.730 --> 34:24.660
followed Li Yunrui

34:24.660 --> 34:25.670
and betrayed the Investigator's Office.

34:25.690 --> 34:26.600
He's dead already.

34:26.620 --> 34:27.930
I've heard.

34:28.010 --> 34:29.250
Now that post

34:29.250 --> 34:30.800
remains vacant.

34:30.820 --> 34:32.080
Do you want to take the post?

34:32.100 --> 34:33.370
Not me.

34:33.660 --> 34:34.990
It's you.

34:35.010 --> 34:36.470
I'm not qualified.

34:36.490 --> 34:37.940
After finding out the truth of the smuggling,

34:37.940 --> 34:39.190
you should be qualified.

34:39.210 --> 34:40.190
When we return to the capital city,

34:40.210 --> 34:41.420
I'll try everything I can

34:41.420 --> 34:42.510
to get you the post.

34:42.530 --> 34:44.270
Are you buying me over?

34:44.290 --> 34:46.600
I told you I need your help.

34:46.620 --> 34:48.450
Do you want to form a clique for private gain?

34:48.450 --> 34:50.320
I want to form a clique, but only for public benefits.

34:50.450 --> 34:51.600
The Investigator's Office

34:51.620 --> 34:52.490
is controlled by Chen Pingping

34:52.490 --> 34:53.290
all the time.

34:53.290 --> 34:54.840
It's not a good thing.

34:56.050 --> 34:57.360
Mr. Yan,

34:57.380 --> 34:58.140
can't you do anything

34:58.140 --> 34:59.670
for Nanqing?

34:59.690 --> 35:01.750
Cooperate with me for check and balance.

35:01.770 --> 35:03.600
That's the way to serve our country worthily.

35:04.180 --> 35:05.760
Are you mad?

35:08.180 --> 35:10.800
I've never been so clear.

35:12.010 --> 35:13.840
Do you think I will work with you?

35:18.100 --> 35:20.210
Indeed. I have to wait for the right moment.

35:23.010 --> 35:24.320
You're so ambitious.

35:24.340 --> 35:25.430
I'll tell the Head

35:25.450 --> 35:27.040
after returning to the capital city.

35:35.180 --> 35:36.160
Your Excellency,

35:36.180 --> 35:36.970
there's a woman at the door

35:36.970 --> 35:38.600
wanting to see Mr. Yan.

35:38.820 --> 35:39.710
I told her

35:39.730 --> 35:40.950
Mr. Yan is injured

35:40.970 --> 35:41.770
and it's inconvenient for him to meet visitors.

35:41.770 --> 35:42.920
But she's really stubborn.

35:42.940 --> 35:43.970
I've tried to persuade her for a long time,

35:43.970 --> 35:44.990
but she just wouldn't leave.

35:45.010 --> 35:47.280
Now she's waiting in the yard.

35:48.530 --> 35:49.750
Did she say her name?

35:49.770 --> 35:50.840
She just said she's an old friend of

35:50.860 --> 35:51.880
Mr. Yan,

35:51.900 --> 35:53.800
but she refused to tell who she is.

35:54.690 --> 35:57.080
Gao, thank you. Go and have a rest.

35:57.380 --> 35:58.690
Yes.

36:08.820 --> 36:10.400
Judged from your look,

36:10.420 --> 36:12.410
you don't want to see her, right?

36:34.290 --> 36:35.840
Please stop.

36:45.340 --> 36:46.840
Are you OK?

36:47.210 --> 36:48.800
You're severely injured.

36:48.860 --> 36:50.640
I can see you inside.

36:50.660 --> 36:52.170
No need to come out yourself.

36:54.050 --> 36:54.990
Well,

36:55.010 --> 36:57.120
these are medicines to enrich the blood and heal the wounds.

36:57.140 --> 36:58.470
And here's the medicine for healing the cold.

36:58.490 --> 36:59.360
Some should be taken orally
and the others should be applied externally.

36:59.380 --> 37:01.130
It's all written clearly.

37:01.620 --> 37:02.970
Take them.

37:05.900 --> 37:07.240
Just take them.

37:21.050 --> 37:24.000
I've never loved you.

37:28.820 --> 37:31.650
I... I know.

37:32.250 --> 37:34.600
You've told me.

37:36.100 --> 37:38.600
You approached me

37:38.900 --> 37:41.370
so that you can use my identity

37:41.730 --> 37:43.400
to get military information.

37:43.420 --> 37:45.000
Then why are you here?

37:46.250 --> 37:48.930
I'm just worried about your health.

37:50.660 --> 37:52.970
After all, we know each other.

37:58.290 --> 38:00.450
I can accept your kindness

38:02.580 --> 38:03.270
if you

38:03.290 --> 38:05.080
promise me one condition.

38:05.100 --> 38:06.730
Just go ahead and tell me.

38:10.770 --> 38:13.370
Bring me the head of your elder brother.

38:14.730 --> 38:17.080
If you can place righteousness above family loyalty,

38:17.210 --> 38:19.450
I promise I'll talk to you

38:19.450 --> 38:21.080
as we used to.

38:24.290 --> 38:26.370
We can even be intimate

38:26.490 --> 38:28.370
if you want.

38:32.140 --> 38:34.080
If you couldn't bear to kill him

38:34.100 --> 38:36.030
with a sword, I can give you a poison.

38:36.050 --> 38:38.210
Put it into his tea,

38:38.210 --> 38:39.970
and let him drink it!

39:23.180 --> 39:25.280
If you really don't love her,

39:25.530 --> 39:27.970
you should talk her into

39:28.210 --> 39:29.840
releasing you when you were caught.

39:29.860 --> 39:31.690
What on earth do you want to say?

39:32.140 --> 39:32.940
I think you've left a place

39:32.940 --> 39:34.670
for her in your heart.

39:34.690 --> 39:36.320
As an official of the Investigator's Office,

39:36.380 --> 39:38.410
how can I have heart?

39:45.860 --> 39:47.240
Your Excellency.

39:55.290 --> 39:56.600
You've seen it all?

39:56.620 --> 39:57.840
Yes.

39:58.940 --> 40:00.010
Do you think

40:00.010 --> 40:01.930
Yan Bingyun is really heartless?

40:01.970 --> 40:04.520
I hope so.

40:05.580 --> 40:06.970
Why?

40:08.450 --> 40:09.760
Just think about it.

40:10.100 --> 40:11.240
Now we are

40:11.490 --> 40:14.170
in the capital of Beiqi.

40:14.210 --> 40:15.970
If we get entangled

40:15.970 --> 40:17.160
with Lady Shen,

40:17.180 --> 40:20.170
Shen Zhong will hate us even more.

40:21.010 --> 40:22.900
Lady Shen came to see Yan Bingyun.

40:22.900 --> 40:24.650
We can't hide it.

40:25.180 --> 40:26.890
Shen Zhong can come if he wants.

40:27.140 --> 40:27.770
I'll wait for him.

40:27.770 --> 40:28.820
Shangshan Hu has already

40:28.820 --> 40:30.050
counted you as his enemy.

40:30.050 --> 40:32.600
Why do you also provoke Shen Zhong?

40:32.820 --> 40:34.120
It's not my style

40:34.140 --> 40:35.600
to keep provoking strong enemies?

40:36.730 --> 40:38.670
Your Excellency,

40:38.690 --> 40:41.230
you were hard to predict,

40:41.250 --> 40:43.230
but you never

40:43.250 --> 40:45.210
asked for trouble.

40:46.010 --> 40:47.450
After coming to the capital city from Danzhou,

40:47.450 --> 40:49.130
I've gone through many things.

40:49.620 --> 40:51.360
Most of the time, trouble found me.

40:51.380 --> 40:53.320
I only responded effectively to the situation,

40:54.450 --> 40:56.160
and I seldom took the initiative.

40:56.180 --> 40:57.370
Do you know why?

40:57.580 --> 40:58.970
No.

40:59.140 --> 40:59.900
Because I only want to

40:59.900 --> 41:01.600
live a happy life.

41:01.620 --> 41:04.450
I want nothing else other than that.

41:05.450 --> 41:07.320
I want to live an easy life.

41:07.820 --> 41:10.210
I've never desired anything.

41:10.660 --> 41:11.290
Nor did I know

41:11.290 --> 41:13.490
my goal for life.

41:14.290 --> 41:16.170
One can be austere if he has no selfish desires.

41:16.940 --> 41:19.040
But now it's different.

41:21.290 --> 41:22.690
Have you found

41:23.140 --> 41:26.450
your goal for life?

41:28.140 --> 41:29.800
Do you know Ye Qingmei?

41:29.820 --> 41:31.130
Yes.

41:31.450 --> 41:32.840
Why was she murdered back then?

41:32.860 --> 41:34.760
I really don't know why.

41:36.050 --> 41:38.080
I originally thought that

41:38.450 --> 41:40.760
by having a successful business

41:40.940 --> 41:42.750
and taking control of the financial power of the world,

41:42.770 --> 41:44.190
she offended someone influential,

41:44.210 --> 41:46.000
so she was murdered.

41:49.210 --> 41:51.970
Is that wrong?

41:52.380 --> 41:55.600
Do you mean Ye Qingmei married into the royal family of Nanqing?

41:55.690 --> 41:56.970
Yeah.

41:57.660 --> 41:59.040
Who did she marry?

41:59.210 --> 42:00.750
He was a prince at that time.

42:00.770 --> 42:05.240
Now, he's the emperor of Nanqing.

42:06.450 --> 42:08.280
Now I see.

42:08.690 --> 42:10.190
As a consort,

42:10.210 --> 42:12.470
she shouldn't die in obscurity.

42:12.490 --> 42:14.430
The truth is hidden by someone.

42:14.450 --> 42:16.760
Since it's a top secret,

42:16.970 --> 42:19.800
petty officials like us are not supposed to know it.

42:19.820 --> 42:21.210
You're right.

42:24.250 --> 42:25.420
So I've got

42:25.420 --> 42:27.040
a goal for my life.

42:27.660 --> 42:29.520
I know what I want to do.

42:36.290 --> 42:38.490
I want to be the Head of the Investigator's Office

42:38.530 --> 42:40.800
and become the most powerful minister in Nanqing.

43:05.640 --> 43:09.220
In the river of history,

43:09.240 --> 43:12.710
time goes round and round.

43:15.520 --> 43:18.860
Memories about the former and present lives

43:18.880 --> 43:22.950
join each other in an endless way.

43:24.840 --> 43:27.460
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:27.480 --> 43:29.720
one season follows another in a flash,

43:29.720 --> 43:32.220
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:32.240 --> 43:33.840
I just can't give up

43:33.840 --> 43:37.180
to be with you for my whole life.

43:37.200 --> 43:42.670
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:43.920 --> 43:46.470
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:46.760 --> 43:48.800
Year after year in the wandering,

43:48.800 --> 43:51.460
I count the remaining years.

43:51.480 --> 43:53.660
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:53.680 --> 43:55.670
even though we have ended up the destiny,

43:55.960 --> 43:58.350
I never feel regretful.

43:58.400 --> 43:59.760
In such a chaotic world,

43:59.760 --> 44:02.740
I still miss you as ever.

44:02.760 --> 44:05.710
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:06.000 --> 44:08.060
With a gentle heart,

44:08.080 --> 44:10.740
I cherish our remaining years.

44:10.760 --> 44:12.280
Even though we have to go through

44:12.280 --> 44:14.790
all the hardships along the journey,

44:14.920 --> 44:22.110
you always stay by my side,

44:22.200 --> 44:24.870
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:25.160 --> 44:27.240
Year after year in the wandering,

44:27.240 --> 44:29.900
I count the remaining years.

44:29.920 --> 44:32.060
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:32.080 --> 44:34.310
even though we end up the destiny,

44:34.520 --> 44:36.700
I never feel regretful.

44:36.720 --> 44:38.120
In such a chaotic world,

44:38.120 --> 44:41.180
I still miss you as ever.

44:41.200 --> 44:44.310
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:44.400 --> 44:46.540
With a gentle heart,

44:46.560 --> 44:49.260
I cherish our remaining years.

44:49.280 --> 44:50.720
Even though we have to go through

44:50.720 --> 44:53.380
all the hardships along the journey,

44:53.400 --> 45:02.160
you always stay by my side...
